"u":"https://bkt-sgp-miui-ota-update-alisgp.oss-ap-southeast-1.aliyuncs.com/OS2.0.203.0.VPQCNXM/kunzite_images_OS2.0.203.0.VPQCNXM_20250818.0000.00_15.0_cn_36f9b2562c.tgz"},{"cn":"kunzite","rg":"China","br":"Stable Beta","m":"Recovery","v":"OS2.0.201.0.VPQCNXM","an":"15.0","d":"","sz":"5.4 GB","md5":"6f924d71a237b67bc19905b04b8f0843","u":"https://bigota.d.miui.com/OS2.0.201.0.VPQCNXM/kunzite-ota_full-OS2.0.201.0.VPQCNXM-user-15.0-6f924d71a2.zip","cl":"[System animations]\nOptimization: Interrupt animation when entering subpages within apps\nOptimization: Interrupt animation during app transitions\nOptimization: Interrupt animation when closing apps in Landscape mode\n[System]\nNew: Home screen wallpaper now supports a blur effect\nOptimization: Immersive effect for full screen indicator in certain scenarios\nOptimization: Updated styles for some classic pages\nOptimization: Animation effects when launching apps\nOptimization: In certain screens, larger text sizes are now supported\nOptimization: Stability of animations when opening and closing apps\nOptimization: Scrolling performance on content feeds in some third party apps\nFix: Issues with animations when opening or closing apps\nFix: Gestures didn't work properly in certain scenarios\nFix: Wallpapers disappeared in rare cases when opening or closing apps\nFix: Occasional display glitches when opening or closing apps\nUpdated the security patch to July 2025. Increased system security.\n[Home screen]\nNew: Home screen icon text now displays shadows over light wallpaper areas for better readability\n[Basic experience]\nOptimization: Tweaked the Storage refresh algorithm so it activates more often\n[App vault]\nNew: Travel assistant now supports adding trips manually\n[Lock screen]\nNew: Eastern aesthetics lock screen templates\nNew: Lock screen wallpapers now support lens effect\nNew: Customizable Lock screen shortcuts\nOptimization: Fingerprint unlock now supports new animations\n[Settings]\nOptimization: Added a shortcut to system navigation settings in Home screen settings\n[Status bar, Notification shade]\nNew: Some status bar icons now support custom display\nOptimization: Custom notifications now support unfolding\nOptimization: HD signal icon no longer permanently shown in the status bar\n[Accessibility]\nFix: Touch gestures stopped working in TalkBack mode\nFix: Volume buttons didn't work in TalkBack mode\nFix: Issues that prevented Recorder from capturing TalkBack audio\nFix: Issues with announcements for unselected items in Calendar and other apps\nFix: Some buttons weren't announced in several apps, including Settings, Control center, Messaging, Contacts, Weather, Notes, and Browser\nMore accessibility fixes are available in Xiaomi Community"}]}